#*: A strength of this book is Qualman′s ability to take complex issues and break them into easily digestible '''takeaways''' through the use of real world examples and analogies.

====Usage notes====
In sense “idea from presentation etc.”, frequently used in plural to refer to all important ideas contained therein; compare {{m|en|insights}}, {{m|en|lessons learned}}, {{m|en|learnings}}, etc.

